WEBVTT

00:21.249 --> 00:23.190
The

00:31.494 --> 00:35.617
skyline wakes up when the sun goes down.

00:38.848 --> 00:43.909
A million electric eyes over the town.

00:45.690 --> 00:52.812
Turn the key and feel the hum in the floor. We're

00:52.852 --> 00:58.573
leaving the shadows right outside the door.

00:59.733 --> 01:07.525
Catch the neon pulse riding on the wire. Racing

01:07.565 --> 01:15.227
through the streets Blowing like a fire No

01:15.267 --> 01:19.468
looking back We're out of frame Running on the

01:19.508 --> 01:26.229
spark Wild and untamed Catch the neon pulse

01:26.289 --> 01:27.449
tonight

01:34.537 --> 01:35.178
The End

01:45.112 --> 01:51.237
The dashboard is glowing a steady bright green.

01:52.478 --> 01:59.063
The fastest escape that this city has seen. The

01:59.123 --> 02:04.147
rhythm is beating right

02:04.707 --> 02:08.410
under our feet. A steady transmission.

02:10.274 --> 02:17.260
Out on the street. Catch the neon pulse. Riding

02:17.761 --> 02:23.486
on the wire. Racing through the streets.

02:23.686 --> 02:30.612
Glowing like a fire. No looking back. We're out

02:30.712 --> 02:34.516
of the frame. Burning on the spark. Wild and

02:34.676 --> 02:38.568
untamed. Catch the neon pulse tonight

03:17.343 --> 03:22.665
Through the tunnel of lights, blinding and fast

03:25.246 --> 03:28.567
Everything broken is left in the past

03:31.968 --> 03:36.170
Hold on to the wheel, steady and sure

03:38.530 --> 03:45.813
We're chasing a frequency, perfect and pure

04:04.891 --> 04:07.874
Catch

04:13.719 --> 04:21.727
the neon pulse Riding on the wire Racing through

04:21.767 --> 04:29.715
the streets Glowing like a fire No looking back

04:29.735 --> 04:34.417
We're out of the frame Running on the spark Wild

04:34.518 --> 04:41.882
and untamed Catch the neon pulse tonight

04:44.623 --> 04:47.105
Wild and untamed

04:50.047 --> 04:51.467
Catch the pulse tonight

